          "sha256": "3095b71c017cfb9787bdc11efdd4e9f92355453a0627b5356416bf21901c2037"
        },
        "statement": "默认第一页输入带首尾空格名称并查询；组件声明trim查询词、pageNum=1与pageSize=10。名称失焦DOM raw/trim待确认，只断言GET名称trim和其他select/date默认状态。不新增第二页数据前置。"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "S-R4-009",
        "oracle_type": "declaration",
        "ref": {
          "path": "qa/ui/scopes/pms-contract-deployment-20261030/operation-contract.js",
          "sha256": "3095b71c017cfb9787bdc11efdd4e9f92355453a0627b5356416bf21901c2037"
        },
        "statement": "默认第一页把六项条件全部设为非默认后直接重置；部门仅选UI首个可见非全部项，作为可替换输入，准备状态departmentNonDefault严格true。重置将两输入/双日期清空、三个select恢复全部，并GET第一页无筛选；独立部门ID映射属于004，不是009前置或oracle。"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "S-R4-API",
        "oracle_type": "declaration",
        "ref": {
          "path": "qa/ui/scopes/pms-contract-deployment-20261030/operation-contract-api.txt",
          "sha256": "6d3d0a17fa92105853a1936b99a2ea9c27eaec8970a0c354810ac5edc4db6476"
