        "statement": "ba.page调用kt.pageGet(operation-contract/page,e)，查询只读。"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "S-R4-SHARED",
        "oracle_type": "declaration",
        "ref": {
          "path": "qa/ui/assets/pms-contract-query-reset/revisions/r4/shared-source.txt",
          "sha256": "e86343852d510b589fe78f9fc90cca9d1681626327719381c9ef8fcb9025acb2"
        },
        "statement": "当前bundle精确原文小摘录：CSearchBar按钮顺序/折叠、search-item/search-label、项目类型枚举、部门映射、page transport与axios省略undefined。shared-source-provenance.json保留code-point offset与原归档摘要字符串；完整gzip不进入评审FileRef闭包。部门映射仅作组件来源，不构成009独立ID oracle。"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "S-R4-RECORDED",
        "oracle_type": "baseline",
        "ref": {
          "path": "qa/ui/recordings/pms-operation-contract-observe-v14/draft.spec.ts",
          "sha256": "3c3771d7d233467cf1878c9f6690fa77ca5212dcbf8db1d41590f57cec17d592"
        },
        "statement": "历史v14录制仅名称输入、查询、重置及其placeholder/button定位；初始4条不要求第二页。不是本轮执行或当前部署定位器实测。"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "S-R4-SEED",
        "oracle_type": "baseline",
        "ref": {
          "path": "qa/ui/pms-operation-contract/seed-v14.spec.ts",
          "sha256": "14b998b9e137b5f8d1c03398c0cb50a6b49e5af873e885c361e7c5e06e7cd5de"
        },
        "statement": "真实v14 seed身份协议：localStorage token若可解析为JSON字符串则解码；headers token、x-parent-client-code=pms、x-client-code=pms；只返回HTTP/profile.code/username匹配布尔值。"
      }
    ],
    "cases": [
      {
        "case_id": "PMS-OC-SRC-001",
        "module_id": "operation-contract",
        "feature_id": "current-source-query-reset",
        "scenario_id": "oc-src-001",
        "title": "合同名称去空白查询",
        "priority": "P0",
        "preconditions": [
          "依据2026-10-30冻结部署声明，readiness=design-only；未核验当前认证DOM/定位器。",
          "保留原task/scope/inventory/budget；role精确匹配configured account; business role not yet verified，不推断业务角色。",
          "pi-ui-testing/fixtures每case隔离context；真实PMS使用v14 seed原样token和两个client headers，仅返回账号匹配布尔。auth:none仅限loopback且body[data-controlled-diagnostic=true]与synthetic profile匹配。",
          "原生fixture负责site/identity/initial-state；脚本核对默认第一页、六项默认状态与稳定网络；结构/身份失败attach ui-preflight blocked并抛错，不skip。",
